Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?P2:=20GPX=20Import/Export=20=E2=80=94=20parser,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20builder,=20elevation=20profile,=20UI=20integration?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- src/lib/gpx/types.ts: GPXPoint, GPXTrack, GPXStats, ImportedGPXRoute
- src/lib/gpx/geo.ts: Haversine distance + gain/loss/bounds stats
- src/lib/gpx/parser.ts: DOMParser-based GPX 1.1 parser (trkpt/rtept), file reader
- src/lib/gpx/builder.ts: GPX builder (from route waypoints or full track), GPS string parsing, download helper
- src/lib/gpx/elevationProfile.ts: inline SVG elevation-vs-distance chart
- src/services/gpxService.ts: localStorage persistence for imported GPX tracks
- src/components/gpx/GPXImportModal.tsx: upload/drag-drop, stats preview, elevation chart, save
- Sidebar: 'Импортирай GPX трак' button
- DetailedRouteView: 'Изтегли GPX' export button (from hut GPS coordinates)
- PlananaApp: wiring for GPX import modal + export handler
